---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_canceled: saleCanceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_not_canceled: sale not canceled
    q_revert_not_canceled --> [*]: revert SaleNotCanceled
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_invested: sale is canceled
    q_check_invested --> q_check_already_withdrawn: investorPosition.totalInvested > 0
    q_check_invested --> q_revert_no_invest: no investment
    q_revert_no_invest --> [*]: revert NoInvestmentFound
    q_check_already_withdrawn --> q_calculate: not already withdrawn
    q_check_already_withdrawn --> q_revert_withdrawn: already withdrawn
    q_revert_withdrawn --> [*]: revert AlreadyWithdrawn
    q_calculate --> q_transfer: amount = investorPosition.totalInvested
    q_transfer --> q_update_state: transfer bidToken to investor
    q_update_state --> q_emit: mark position as withdrawn
    q_emit --> [*]: emit CanceledCapitalWithdrawn(investor, amount)

    note right of q_calculate
        INV-001: Only callable when sale is canceled
        INV-002: Full invested amount returned to investor
        INV-003: Each investor can withdraw once after cancellation
    end note
